sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor TK as Thủ kho
  participant FE as React App
  participant GW as Spring Cloud Gateway
  participant ORD as order-service
  participant INV as inventory-service
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant REP as report-service
  TK->>FE: Tạo phiếu xuất (kho HN01)
  FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/export-slips (JWT, X-Warehouse-Id)
  GW->>ORD: forward + user context
  ORD->>INV: Feign POST /internal/stock/check (SP, kho)
  INV-->>ORD: tồn khả dụng + tồn các kho khác
  alt Không đủ hàng
    ORD-->>FE: 409 + gợi ý kho khác (tách phiếu / chuyển kho)
  else Đủ hàng
    ORD->>INV: Feign POST /internal/stock/reserve (Idempotency-Key)
    INV-->>ORD: hold_id (trừ tồn khả dụng)
    ORD-->>FE: 201 PXK PENDING
  end
  TK->>FE: Xác nhận xuất
  FE->>GW: POST /api/v1/export-slips/:id/export
  GW->>ORD: forward
  ORD->>INV: Feign POST /internal/stock/commit (hold_id) — @Transactional + @Version
  INV-->>ORD: OK (trừ tồn thực, ghi stock_movements)
  ORD->>ORD: status=EXPORTED + outbox(export.exported)
  ORD-)MQ: export.exported
  INV-)MQ: stock.changed / stock.low
  MQ-)REP: @RabbitListener cập nhật fact_sales, tạo cảnh báo
  REP-)FE: STOMP /user/queue/notifications
